triggers.tooltip:
Activate a |cffffffffFetid Ward|r on yourself and your Undead minions for $d.

While active, $s1% of your damage dealt heals you and your minions, split evenly amongst them, and healing received is increased by $s2%.

@ext:Only 1 |cffffffffWard|r can be active at a time.:ext@

